Package: bl
Type: Package
Title: Useful convenience functions for the biodiversity and landscape ecology group
Version: 0.1.1
Author: Florian Fumy
Maintainer: Florian Fumy <florian.fumy@uos.de>
Description: This package provides a set of custom functions for data management and ease of result creation. It also includes functions to ease the creation of graphs.
